## DOMAIN_CHECKLIST (embedded into every DEV_PROMPTS)

When creating `docs/artifacts/DEV_PROMPTS_*.md`, @ARCH must add a section:

```markdown
## Domain Checklist
Type: [Schedule / Finance / CRM / Dashboard / Analytics / Settings / Loyalty]
Source: roles/DOMAIN_STANDARDS.md#[type]

- [ ] ...list from DOMAIN_STANDARDS.md...

@QA_ARCH checks this list before issuing 🟢
```

